true] [17592186250151 1113 #uuid "60eda413-97e0-5606-bb17-3d5a70d41bae" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250151 1145 "First, we write\n\n$$\nv(t)=2{csc}^{2}⁡(t).\n$$\n\nNow, we see that $v(t)$ can be expressed as the composite function\n\n$$\nv=2{u}^{2},\\,u=\\operatorname{csc}⁡t.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}u}=4u,\\,\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t}=-\\operatorname{csc}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t.\n$$\n\nWe now apply the chain rule and get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}a(t) & ={v}^{′}(t) \\\\  & =\\frac{\\text{d}v}{\\text{d}u}\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}t} \\\\  & =4u\\cdot (-\\operatorname{csc}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t) \\\\  & =(4\\operatorname{csc}⁡t)\\cdot (-\\operatorname{csc}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t) \\\\  & =-4{csc}^{2}⁡t\\operatorname{cot}⁡t.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250152 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250153 13194139533772 true] [17592186250152 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533772 true] [17592186250152 1041 "field-1" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250152 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250153 13194139533772 true] [17592186250152 1110 #uuid "50569ae4-39a3-5913-8892-6604eeae4381" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250153 1034 "-4\\csc(t)^2" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250153 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533772 true] [17592186250153 1111 #uuid "8b3e27fd-fe2a-5723-821f-acf7a4f9ddaa" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250154 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250155 13194139533772 true] [17592186250154 1089 "q-167569" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250154 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533772 true] [17592186250154 1100 "The velocity, in $\\text{m/s}$, of a subatomic particle is modeled using the function $v(t)=2{csc}^{2}⁡(t)$ for $\\pi <t<2\\pi .$\n\nEarlier part 1:\n\nFind the velocity of the particle at $t=\\frac{7\\pi }{6}.$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                                        \n                                            \n\n                                              