                                      \n                                        $\\cdot \\operatorname{cot}⁡t$\n\nCurrent part:\n\n$\\int v(t)\\,\\text{d}t\\,\\,=\\,$\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                         $+\\text{ }C$" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250154 1113 #uuid "3047aa7e-6cb6-5d26-9ed3-c77c14702d2b" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250154 1145 "Recall that \n\n$$\n\\int {csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t=-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t+C.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int 2{csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t & =2\\int {csc}^{2}⁡t\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =2(-\\operatorname{cot}⁡t)+C \\\\  & =-2\\operatorname{cot}⁡t+C.\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250155 1000 #edb/ref 17592186250156 13194139533772 true] [17592186250155 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139533772 true] [17592186250155 1041 "field-1" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250155 1104 #edb/ref 17592186250156 13194139533772 true] [17592186250155 1110 #uuid "51b03522-97ff-5129-abe9-98947e7a422f" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250156 1034 "-2\\cot(t)" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250156 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533772 true] [17592186250156 1111 #uuid "218a4b91-c70a-5d7a-bd0f-36310f6f2df6" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250157 1017 #edb/ref 17592186250158 13194139533772 true] [17592186250157 1089 "q-167570" 13194139533772 true] [17592186250157 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139533772 true] [17592186250157 1100 "The velocity, in $\\text{m/s}$, of a subatomic particle is modeled using the function $v(t)=2{csc}^{2}⁡(t)$ for $\\pi <t<2\\pi .$\n\nEarlier part 1:\n\nFind the velocity of the particle at $t=\\frac{7\\pi }{6}.$\n\n                       